--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Inspiration
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The concept of driving the SAP ABAP Development Tools (ADT) protocol from
outside the SAP GUI was inspired by Marcello Urbani's project:

    vscode_abap_remote_fs
    https://github.com/marcellourbani/vscode_abap_remote_fs
    (MIT License)

No code from vscode_abap_remote_fs is used in this project.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
